			tip = "Plays as your Kick, Counterspell, Pummel, Shield Bash, Earth Shock or your Felhunter's Spell Lock stops an enemy's cast, at most once a second. It plays when the game names you or your pet as the one who stopped the cast, on any enemy, a stun or silence of yours too, so a kick that missed, came late or came after another player's stays silent. When the game keeps that secret, it follows the target or focus bar turning Interrupted right after your interrupt. Plays once as you pick it.",
