			tip = "For a buff or weapon enchant that lasts 10 minutes or more, in a dungeon or raid: the larger of this and Low at. 0 means the same as elsewhere. In a fight, a tracker set to Only when low or missing still hides while its buff is up, so the warning shows between pulls." },
